# Opening Edge / ply-chess
# Copy to .env.local. Never commit real values.

# --- Auth (public only — safe in the browser) ---
# Dedicated Opening Edge Supabase project. See LAUNCH.md.
# Google client secret stays in the Supabase dashboard. Phone OTP is deferred.
NEXT_PUBLIC_SUPABASE_URL=
NEXT_PUBLIC_SUPABASE_PUBLISHABLE_KEY=
# NEXT_PUBLIC_SUPABASE_ANON_KEY=

# --- Lichess explorer (server only) ---
# Practice weights opponent replies from the Lichess database
# (blitz and rapid, ratings 1200–2000). Without a token the explorer
# returns 401 and Practice keeps an even pick among stored branches.
LICHESS_TOKEN=

# --- Coach (server only — never expose these to the browser) ---
# The bubble uses the first key that is set. Prefer the gateway key.
# Model: Anthropic Claude Sonnet 5.5. Ten questions per browser per Paris day.
AI_GATEWAY_API_KEY=
# ANTHROPIC_API_KEY=
